<title>UK: Simon Engineering EGM approves name change.</title>
<headline>Simon Engineering EGM approves name change.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simon Engineering Plc said on Tuesday its shareholders had approved at an EGM yesterday, a change of name to Simon Group Plc.</p>
<p>It also said in a statement that the FTSE Actuaries Index Classification Committee on Monday approved the company's reclassification from 'Engineering, general' to 'Business support services'.</p>
<p>The change will be effective from July 1.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
